<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Feed to tender 54,000 tonnes U.S. corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Feed to tender 54,000 tonnes U.S. corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-05-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Members Feed Industry Group would tender on Thursday for a 54,000-tonne shipment of U.S. No.2 corn, traders said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The feed group's main buyers are Taiwan's Formosa Oilseed, Fomau Cereal, Morn Sun Feed Mill and Shin Tai Industry.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p>		U.S. Gulf     Pacific N.W.</p>
<p> 54,000     July 1-15     July 16-30</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
